{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S08—S12等短停留段的信息密度偏高，连续扫读不如Y的左右分栏轻松，部分感受词来不及消化。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X虽然更费眼睛，但【】突出的人物心理节点让人很容易抓住每段核心，叙述也把舍不得、受过的气、害怕孤单和不愿回头之间的因果关系交代得更具体。更重要的是，X的感受不只是情绪标签，而是通过旋律、节奏、音色、身体反应和具体记忆的变化，把前后段落串成一条细腻的心理过程；Y更容易扫读，但压缩掉了一些音乐变化和情绪转折的层次。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "40626991-dbef-413e-895e-64a41f24d2e3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T231042588786Z", "elapsed_seconds": 63.797, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:11:46.403951+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2dba090ef3e74953999b1aee4ac6ac8d3741984c92374069cd14c6ff2b3f0de6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eed